1 0 0 1 50 751 Tm
(1. Architecture Overview) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 731 Tm
(- Database: Managed PostgreSQL on Supabase for relational employee records.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 716 Tm
(- Storage: Private Supabase Storage bucket \(onboarding-docs\) for documents.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 701 Tm
(- Backend API: Express / Node.js service hosted on Render PaaS.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 686 Tm
(- Frontend: Vite + React SPA served via Cloudflare Workers.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 671 Tm
(- Domain: onboarding.infiniticodetech.com pointed via CNAME on Wix DNS.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 13 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 648 Tm
(2. Step 1: Set up Supabase Project) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 628 Tm
(1. Go to supabase.com and create a new project named infiniti-onboarding.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 613 Tm
(2. Save the database password securely.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 598 Tm
(3. Copy the Connection Pooling PostgreSQL URI from Settings -> Database.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
1 0 0 1 60 583 Tm
(postgresql://postgres:[PASSWORD]@db.[PROJECT-REF].supabase.co:5432/postgres?sslmode=require) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 569 Tm
(4. In Storage -> Buckets -> Create new private bucket named: onboarding-docs) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 554 Tm
(5. In Project Settings -> API -> copy Project URL and service_role secret key.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 13 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 531 Tm
