(4. Step 3: Run Prisma Migrations and Seed) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 772 Tm
(From the project root on your machine, initialize the Supabase schema:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
1 0 0 1 60 757 Tm
(cd server) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
1 0 0 1 60 743 Tm
(npx prisma migrate dev --name init) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
1 0 0 1 60 729 Tm
(npm run seed) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 715 Tm
(This creates the User, EmployeeProfile, Document, and Invitation tables in Supabase.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 13 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 692 Tm
(5. Step 4: Deploy the Backend API to Render) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 672 Tm
(1. Push this repository to GitHub.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 657 Tm
(2. On render.com, click New + -> Web Service and select your repo.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 642 Tm
(3. Set Root Directory to: server) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 627 Tm
(4. Set Build Command to: npm install && npx prisma generate) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 612 Tm
(5. Set Start Command to: npx prisma migrate deploy && node src/index.js) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 597 Tm
(6. Add the environment variables from server/.env into the Render dashboard.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 582 Tm
(7. Deploy the service and copy your public HTTPS URL \(e.g. https://api.onrender.com\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 13 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 559 Tm
(6. Step 5: Configure Cloudflare Worker Proxy) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 539 Tm
(Update worker/index.js to proxy /api/* to your Render backend URL.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 524 Tm
(In wrangler.jsonc, set vars.BACKEND_URL to your Render URL.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 509 Tm
(Run the deployment commands:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
1 0 0 1 60 494 Tm
(npx wrangler login) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
1 0 0 1 60 480 Tm
(npm run build) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
1 0 0 1 60 466 Tm
(npm run deploy) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
ET
BT
/F1 13 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 444 Tm
(7. Step 6: Connect Domain in Wix DNS) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 424 Tm
(1. In Cloudflare Worker -> Settings -> Domains -> add onboarding.infiniticodetech.com) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 409 Tm
(2. In Wix DNS Manager, add a CNAME record with host "onboarding" pointing to Cloudflare.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 394 Tm
(3. Do not modify the existing root @ or www records on Wix.) Tj
ET

